title: F5OS Platform CPU Utilization
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/f5
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 Monitors the aggregate CPU utilization of an F5 Networks rSeries appliance
 running F5OS. Reports current, 5-second, 1-minute, and 5-minute average
 utilization percentages. The 1-minute average is used for threshold evaluation.

discovery:
 One service is created per device.
